You have N packages with weights W[i] (positive). Ship them in order using at most D days. Each day you can ship a consecutive group with total weight ≤ C. Find the minimum C that makes it possible.

Input

N D
W0 W1 ... W(N-1)


Constraints: 1 ≤ N ≤ 2e5, 1 ≤ D ≤ N, 1 ≤ Wi ≤ 1e9
